{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國阿肯色大學和密歇根大學的研究團隊近日展示了一項新技術。他們開發出一種基於石墨烯的能量採集裝置，能夠從周圍電力線路產生的環境電磁輻射中獲取能量，並將其轉化為電能，為傳感器提供動力，從而實現無需電池、無需供電線路的獨立運行。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1585420.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.674096+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T07:07:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T10:35:52.328017+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_hash":"3cbf4367cd446e02ac1035d1dd68cc63bcf227081133a8a15fddd892fb5f9213","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}